{"name":"Embarrassed","hex":"#ee7799","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"embarrassed","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Having a feeling of shameful discomfort.","Impeded; obstructed; in an awkward situation."]},{"part":"Verb","definitions":["simple past and past participle of embarrass"]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/embarrassed"}],"entries":[{"title":"Embarrassment","blocks":[{"text":"Embarrassment or awkwardness is an emotional state that is associated with mild to severe levels of discomfort, and which is usually experienced when someone commits a socially unacceptable, or frowned-upon act that is witnessed by or revealed to others. Frequently grouped with shame and guilt embarrassment is considered a \"self-conscious emotion\", and it can have a profoundly negative impact on a person's thoughts or behavior."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bc/Embarrassed_woman.jpg/330px-Embarrassed_woman.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Embarrassment"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg/500px-Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg/1280px-Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/ed/Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg/500px-Antoine_Watteau_014.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"An embarrassing proposal by Antoine Watteau","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3AAntoine_Watteau_014.jpg"}],"sounds":{"embarrassed":[{"type":"audio/wav","src":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/0/00/LL-Q1860_%28eng%29-Flame%2C_not_lame-embarrassed.wav?utm_source=en.w